Enterprise-Hermes adds a governance layer (SSO/RBAC, immutable audit,
human-approval gates, zero-data-egress defaults), a multi-org control plane,
and a deployable appliance wrapper around the MIT-licensed Hermes agent core.

That governance layer ("core/", "agent/", "orchestration/", "admin/", "web/")
is original work of AIdentify and is distributed under the same MIT License.